# Files excluded from `railway up` deploys.
#
# Railway zips the working directory and uploads it; without this list,
# untracked dev helpers and local-only test scaffolding would ride along
# into the production filesystem. None of them is auto-executed by the
# server, but keeping them out of prod keeps the surface tight and
# avoids accidental discovery.

# Local DB-recovery helper, never committed.
.knexfile_recon.js

# Destructive local seed-reset script — must NEVER live on prod.
scripts/reset_nobu_test_data.sh

# Integration tests are run locally and on CI, not on prod runtime.
tests/
